items-center justify-between text-sm"><span class="text-slate-500">Account</span><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500 to-fuchsia-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white text-[16px] leading-none" aria-hidden="true">play_arrow</span></div><span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Alice&#x27;s Wallet</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-400 text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">content_copy</span></div></div></div><div class="my-5 border-t border-slate-100"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex items-start justify-between text-sm gap-6"><span class="text-slate-500 shrink-0">Justification</span><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 text-right">ClawdBot stablecoin budget</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm"><span class="text-slate-500">Networks</span><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><img alt="Ethereum logo" src="/images/logos/networks/ethereum-eth-logo.png" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain"/></div><span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Ethereum</span></div><span class="text-slate-300">·</span><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><img alt="BSC logo" src="/images/logos/networks/binance-logo.png" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain"/></div><span class="font-bold text-slate-900">BSC</span></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm"><span class="text-slate-500">Start date</span><span class="font-bold text-slate-900 tabular-nums">04/20/2026 14:00</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm"><span class="text-slate-500">Expiration date</span><span class="font-bold text-slate-900 tabular-nums">06/07/2026 15:00</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-24 px-8 bg-slate-50/50 border-y border-slate-100"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="mb-10 text-center"><h2 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-400 font-bold">Customer Spotlight</h2></div><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,6fr)] md:items-stretch rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/60"><div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950 flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-6"><img src="/images/blog/GasStation.jpeg" alt="OKX Wallet Gas Station powered by 1Shot API" width="859" height="678" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="relative z-10 max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain rounded-xl"/><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-slate-950/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div><div class="relative p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col"><a href="/blog/okx-wallet-gas-station" aria-label="Read the OKX Wallet Gas Station article" class="absolute top-5 right-5 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#239aaa] text-white flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#1d7f8d] hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-md shadow-cyan-900/10"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">arrow_outward</span></a><div class="mb-8 pr-14"><h3 class="font-headline text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-tight tracking-tight">From EIP to 3M Users — How OKX Wallet Launched the Gas Station</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">OKX Wallet partnered with 1Shot API on their new EIP-7702 wallet standard to enable multi-chain gas abstraction, letting users pay for transactions in the most popular stablecoins.</p><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Powered by our<!-- --> <a href="/solutions/gas-relayer" class="text-[#239aaa] font-semibold hover:underline">permissionless gas abstraction relayer</a>.<!-- --> <a href="/blog/okx-wallet-gas-station" class="text-[#239aaa] font-semibold hover:underline">Read the full case study →</a></p></div><div class="mt-auto border-t border-slate-100 pt-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-cyan-50 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">local_gas_station</span></span><span class="text-slate-900 font-headline font-bold text-sm">Gas Abstraction</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div><div class="font-headline text-xl md:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">3M+</div><div class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-tight">Wallet users</div></div><div><div class="font-headline text-xl md:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">12</div><div class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-tight">Supported chains</div></div><div><div class="font-headline text-xl md:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">0</div><div class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-tight">ETH needed for gas</div></div></div></div></div></article></div></section><section class="py-32 px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-center"><div><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8 leading-tight font-headline">Web3 Infrastructure is<!-- --> <span class="text-slate-400">Complicated</span><br/>We provide the <span class="text-[#239aaa]">1Shot Fix.</span></h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-10 font-body">Fragmentation, high latency, and poor abstraction layers prevent developers from getting their onchain products to market. 1Shot API consolidates everything you need into a single, high-performance execution layer — from our<!-- --> <a href="/solutions/gas-relayer" class="text-[#239aaa] font-semibold hover:underline">permissionless gas abstraction relayer</a> <!-- -->and<!-- --> <a href="/solutions/devplatform" class="text-[#239aaa] font-semibold hover:underline">self-service developer platform</a> <!-- -->to<!-- --> <a href="/solutions/webauthn-prf-wallet" class="text-[#239aaa] font-semibold hover:underline">embedded passkey wallets</a>.</p><div class="space-y-8"><div class="flex items-start space-x-5"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-cyan-100"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa]" aria-hidden="true">hub</span></div><div><h3 class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1 text-lg">Unified Development Experience</h3><p class="text-slate-500">Choose between pay-per-tx public relayers or create a team account and build your own custom relayer solution.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start space-x-5"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-cyan-100"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa]" aria-hidden="true">shield</span></div><div><h3 class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1 text-lg">Institutional Security</h3><p class="text-slate-500">1Shot API server wallets are powered by Google KMS.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-6 border border-slate-100 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/50"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Today · Fragmented</span><span class="text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rose-400">Pain</span></div><div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/70 border border-slate-100 p-5 overflow-hidden"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full text-slate-300" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 400 200"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity="0.6"><path class="problem-dash-flow" d="M 40 40 C 120 20, 180 180, 260 60"></path><path class="problem-dash-flow" style="animation-duration:1.9s" d="M 60 160 C 160 100, 220 40, 360 140"></path><path class="problem-dash-flow" style="animation-duration:1.2s" d="M 20 100 C 140 60, 200 160, 380 90"></path><path class="problem-dash-flow" style="animation-duration:2.3s;animation-direction:reverse" d="M 100 30 C 160 120, 280 80, 340 180"></path><path class="problem-dash-flow" style="animation-duration:1.6s;animation-direction:reverse" d="M 40 180 C 150 140, 240 20, 360 40"></path></g></svg><div class="relative grid grid-cols-4 gap-2"><div class="problem-logo-float -rotate-6 translate-y-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="ethers.js"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/ethers-seeklogo.svg" alt="ethers.js" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div><div class="problem-logo-float rotate-3 -translate-y-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="Alchemy"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/alchemy.avif" alt="Alchemy" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div><div class="problem-logo-float -rotate-3 translate-y-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="Infura"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/infura.jpeg" alt="Infura" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div><div class="problem-logo-float rotate-6 -translate-y-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="Ankr"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/Ankr-logo.svg" alt="Ankr" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div><div class="problem-logo-float -rotate-2 translate-y-3 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="Redis"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/redis.svg" alt="Redis" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div><div class="problem-logo-float rotate-4 -translate-y-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="Etherscan"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/etherscan.svg" alt="Etherscan" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div><div class="problem-logo-float -rotate-5 translate-y-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="Google Cloud KMS"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/google-cloud-svgrepo-com.svg" alt="Google Cloud KMS" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div><div class="problem-logo-float rotate-2 -translate-y-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 flex items-center justify-center h-14 shadow-sm" title="Flashbots"><img src="/images/logos/problemstatement/flashbots_icon.svg" alt="Flashbots" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="max-h-8 max-w-full object-contain grayscale opacity-70"/></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center my-5"><div class="absolute left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-slate-200 to-transparent"></div><div class="problem-pill-pulse relative bg-white border border-[#239aaa]/30 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm"><span class="problem-arrow-bob inline-flex"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-[16px] leading-none" aria-hidden="true">arrow_downward</span></span><span class="text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#239aaa]">1Shot Fix</span></div></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">With 1Shot · Unified</span><span class="text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#239aaa]">One API</span></div><div class="problem-reveal relative rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#239aaa] shadow-lg shadow-cyan-100/60 p-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm shrink-0"><img src="/images/1shot-api-icon.svg" alt="1Shot API" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-contain"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">1Shot API</div><div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-tight">Single execution layer · Institutional grade</div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2"><div class="problem-chip flex items-center gap-2 bg-cyan-50/60 border border-cyan-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-default"><span class="problem-chip-icon inline-flex"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-[18px] leading-none" aria-hidden="true">hub</span></span><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 leading-tight">Unified Public or Private Relayer</span></div><div class="problem-chip flex items-center gap-2 bg-cyan-50/60 border border-cyan-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-default"><span class="problem-chip-icon inline-flex"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-[18px] leading-none" aria-hidden="true">shield_lock</span></span><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 leading-tight">Google KMS Signing</span></div><div class="problem-chip flex items-center gap-2 bg-cyan-50/60 border border-cyan-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-default"><span class="problem-chip-icon inline-flex"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-[18px] leading-none" aria-hidden="true">language</span></span><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 leading-tight">Multi-chain Read/Writes</span></div><div class="problem-chip flex items-center gap-2 bg-cyan-50/60 border border-cyan-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-default"><span class="problem-chip-icon inline-flex"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-[18px] leading-none" aria-hidden="true">bolt</span></span><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 leading-tight">MEV Protection</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="features" class="py-32 px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-20"><h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-headline">Engineered for Performance</h2><p class="text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">The full-stack platform for building sovereign agents, smart wallets, neobanks, and unstoppable money flows.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-6"><div class="md:col-span-3 bg-white p-10 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-cyan-200 transition-all group "><div class=""><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-cyan-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-4xl" aria-hidden="true">token</span></div><h3 class="text-2xl mb-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Account Abstraction</h3><p class=" text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Native EIP-7702 and EIP-7710 support for gasless transactions and delegated transaction execution. Built-in permission context storage.</p></div></div><div class="md:col-span-3 bg-white p-10 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-cyan-200 transition-all group "><div class=""><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-cyan-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-4xl" aria-hidden="true">smart_toy</span></div><h3 class="text-2xl mb-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Smart Contract Skills</h3><p class=" text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Curated prompts allow agentic coding tools to build with smart contracts across a variety of blockchains while minimizing token usage and guessing solutions.</p></div></div><div class="md:col-span-2 bg-white p-8 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-cyan-200 transition-all group "><div class=""><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">bolt</span></div><h3 class="text-xl mb-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Built-in MEV Protection</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Transactions are automatically routed through the optimal MEV-protected RPC providers.</p></div></div><div class="md:col-span-2 bg-white p-8 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-cyan-200 transition-all group "><div class=""><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">key</span></div><h3 class="text-xl mb-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Relayer Key Management</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">1Shot API relayer keys are hosted in Google KMS and provide low-latency transaction relaying for your user and agent-facing applications.</p></div></div><div class="md:col-span-2 bg-white p-8 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-cyan-200 transition-all group "><div class=""><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa] text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">monitoring</span></div><h3 class="text-xl mb-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Real-time Analytics</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Full historical visibility into your function calls, gas usage, and transaction status.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-32 px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto bg-slate-50 rounded-[3rem] my-16 border border-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-100/30 blur-[100px] rounded-full -mr-48 -mt-48"></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center"><div><h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8 font-headline">Developer Experience <br/> redefined.</h2><p class="text-slate-600 mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed">We spent 10,000 hours optimizing our Web3 tools so you can build your core product in 10 minutes. No boilerplate, no nonsense.</p><ul class="space-y-6"><li class="flex items-center space-x-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa]" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span><span class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">First-class support for ERC-7702 and EIP-7710</span></li><li class="flex items-center space-x-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa]" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span><span class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">Unified transaction history and error visibility</span></li><li class="flex items-center space-x-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#239aaa]" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span><span class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">Multi-chain reads and writes</span></li></ul><div class="mt-10"><div class="text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-4">Plug the 1Shot MCP into your coding agent</div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a href="https://cursor.com/en-US/install-mcp?name=1Shot%20API&amp;config=eyJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL21jcC4xc2hvdGFwaS5jb20vbWNwIiwidHJhbnNwb3J0Ijoic3RyZWFtYWJsZUh0dHAiLCJhdXRoIjp7IkNMSUVOVF9JRCI6IlA1SmR1dzgwdnBWQUlOZ1c4bG5Od2dhazlBTGdmQklTIiwic2NvcGVzIjpbIm9wZW5pZCIsInByb2ZpbGUiLCJlbWFpbCIsIm9mZmxpbmVfYWNjZXNzIl19LCJoZWFkZXJzIjp7fX0%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5" aria-label="Add 1Shot API MCP to Cursor"><img src="/images/logos/agents/add-to-cursor.svg" alt="Add to Cursor" width="140" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-8 w-auto"/></a><a href="https://replit.com/integrations?mcp=eyJkaXNwbGF5TmFtZSI6IjFTaG90IEFQSSIsImJhc2VVcmwiOiJodHRwczovL21jcC4xc2hvdGFwaS5jb20vbWNwIn0=" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5" aria-label="Add 1Shot API MCP to Replit"><img src="/images/logos/agents/add-to-replit.svg" alt="Add to Replit" width="140" height="36" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-9 w-auto"/></a></div></div></div><div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 bg-slate-800/50 border-b border-slate-800 gap-3"><div class="hidden sm:flex space-x-2 shrink-0"><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400/80"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400/80"></div></div><div role="tablist" aria-label="Code preview" class="flex items-center gap-1 p-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-x-auto [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden [-ms-overflow-style:none] [scrollbar-width:none]"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="shrink-0 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-md transition-all whitespace-nowrap bg-[#239aaa] text-white shadow-sm"><span class="sm:hidden">SDK</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">execute_transaction.js</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="shrink-0 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-md transition-all whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200"><span class="sm:hidden">MCP</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">mcp_config.json</span></button></div></div><div class="p-8 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto text-slate-300"><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">01</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-cyan-400">import </span><span class="text-white">{ OneShotClient } </span><span class="text-cyan-400">from </span><span class="text-emerald-400">&#x27;@1shotapi/client-sdk&#x27;</span><span>;</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">02</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span> </span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">03</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-slate-500">// Initialize Transaction</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">04</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-cyan-400">const </span><span class="text-white">client = </span><span class="text-cyan-400">new </span><span class="text-amber-300">OneShotClient</span><span>({</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">05</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-white">  apiKey: </span><span class="text-amber-300">process</span><span class="text-white">.env.API_KEY_1SHOT</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">06</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-white">  apiSecret: </span><span class="text-amber-300">process</span><span class="text-white">.env.API_SECRET_1SHOT</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">07</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-white">});</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">08</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span> </span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">09</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-cyan-400">await </span><span class="text-white">client.contractMethods.</span><span class="text-amber-300">execute</span><span>({</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">10</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-white">  contractMethodId: </span><span class="text-emerald-400">&#x27;d53a7e53-2576-4f8c-a825-ae18b59826ca&#x27;</span><span>,</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">11</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-white">  params: { owner: </span><span class="text-emerald-400">&quot;0x...&quot;</span><span> },</span></span></div><div class="flex"><span class="text-slate-600 mr-4">12</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="text-white">})</span></span></div><div class="mt-8 flex items-center space-x-2 text-[#239aaa] font-label text-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">terminal</span><span>Transaction executed: 0x221...ff4e</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-32 text-center px-8 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-50/30 -z-10"></div><h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8 tracking-tighter font-headline">Ready to <span class="text-gradient">1Shot Web3?</span></h2><p class="text-slate-500 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12 text-lg">Join thousands of developers building the future of autonomous finance.</p><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-5"><a href="https://app.1shotapi.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-[#239aaa] text-white px-12 py-5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xl shadow-xl shadow-cyan-200 hover:bg-[#1d7f8d] hover:-translate-y-1 t